{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24585","headline":"病中宴坐 · 白居易","name":"病中宴坐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有酒病不饮，有诗慵不吟。\n头眩罢垂钩，手痹休援琴。\n竟日悄无事，所居闲且深。\n外安支离体，中养希夷心。\n窗户纳秋景，竹木澄夕阴。\n宴坐小池畔，清风时动襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24585.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24585","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}